       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Oh, by the...\\.\\. Dear, why did we have to go to this shady place?",
       "transl": "Um Himmels willen...\\.\\. Schatz, warum mussten wir zum Essen ausgerechnet in dieses schäbige Loch hier gehen?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "rookie-harbor.female-tall-green",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "B-but I heard they have the best food in the entire city.",
       "transl": "A-Aber ich habe gehört, das Essen hier sei das beste in der ganzen Stadt."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "rookie-harbor.man-small-brown",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Sorry\\..\\..\\.. Bye...",
       "transl": "Sorry\\..\\..\\.. Bye..."
      },
      "person": {
